This product includes a model that was trained on:

  * Home-Assistant-Requests-V2 by acon96 (https://huggingface.co/datasets/acon96/Home-Assistant-Requests-V2), MIT License.
    The requests and tool calls were converted to a flat format, repaired by rules, filtered, and extended with paraphrases.

  * Paraphrases of the training requests that were generated with a large language model (Gemini) and filtered automatically.

  * Template-generated requests for locks, gates, whole rooms and short phrasing.

